DESCRIPTION:Settle in for an afternoon of smoky flavors and summertime tr
 adition at Skyline Kitchen & Bar with our All-American BBQ Sundays. This 
 hearty seasonal feature includes a half rack of tender\, slow-cooked ribs
  served with classic backyard favorites including baked beans\, creamy co
 le slaw\, warm cornbread\, and whipped honey butter. Whether you’re gat
 hering after a day on the golf course\, spending time with family\, or si
 mply soaking in the spirit of summer at Oglebay\, it’s the perfect way 
 to enjoy a relaxed Sunday filled with great food\, scenic views\, and all
 -American flavor. Make Reservations\nSchedule note: Every Sunday\nCategor
 ies: Food And Wine\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/all-american-b
 bq-dinners/
