SUMMARY:Jam Night
DTSTART:20260917T230000Z
DTEND:20260918T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Ohio Valley Gigs every Thursday night for the premier mu
 sician’s jam session at the historic Waterfront Hall. Whether you are a
  seasoned pro looking to network or a rising talent ready to take the sta
 ge for the first time\, this is the place to connect with the local music
  community. The SetupLeave the heavy lifting to us! We provide a full pro
 fessional stage equipped with:Full drum kitGuitar and bass amplifiers pia
 no.Professional PA system and microphones How to PlayThe night is designe
 d for maximum flexibility. You can:Perform Solo: Show off your latest ori
 ginal or a favorite cover.Bring Your Band: Get some stage time with your 
 full group.Jam with the Pros: Don't have a band? Our talented House Band 
 is on standby to sit in and back you up on any style—from blues and roc
 k to jazz and country. Networking & CommunityThis isn't just a concert\; 
 it’s a hub for the Ohio Valley music scene. Use this night to meet pote
 ntial bandmates\, book future gigs\, and support your fellow local artist
 s in a collaborative\, high-energy environment. What to Bring: Just your 
 instrument (guitar\, bass\, horns\, etc.) and your talent! Admission is f
 ree for performers and spectators. Come for the music\, stay for the comm
 unity.\nSchedule note: Every Thursday\nCategories: Music\nSource: https:/
 /wheelingcvb.com/events/jam-night/
LOCATION:Waterfront Hall\, 1230 Water Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/jam-night/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
