SUMMARY:Oktoberfest at Centre Market
DTSTART:20260919T160000Z
DTEND:20260920T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Prost! Join us for Oktoberfest at Centre Market on Saturday\,
  September 19th from 12 until 8pm. There will be live music all day\, inc
 luding a Polka band from 2 until 6pm\, a beer garden with festive and sea
 sonal brews\, and traditional food specials from our vendors in Centre Ma
 rket. Proceeds from the event benefit the Centre Market Fund and the Unit
