SUMMARY:Show of Hands
DTSTART:20260923T220000Z
DTEND:20260924T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Show of Hands is a community crowd-funding event where attend
 ees come together to support impactful local projects and entrepreneurs. 
 For a $5 donation\, participants receive a vote\, hear presentations from
  four selected entrepreneurs\, and help decide which project will receive
  funding. The winning project leaves with an award of at least $3\,000\, 
 plus door donations\, to help make their idea a reality. This event highl
 ights the power of community investment in local ideas and businesses. Wh
 ether you’re interested in supporting innovation or exploring how to la
 unch or grow a business in Wheeling\, Show of Hands offers an engaging an
 d meaningful experience. For more details\, go to https://wheelingheritag
 e.org/show-of-hands/ or follow us on Facebook or Instagram\nSchedule note
 : One Day Only\nCategories: Fundraiser\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/e
 vents/show-of-hands-3/
