SUMMARY:Wheeling AOH Irish Road Bowling 2026 McSweeney Cup
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DESCRIPTION:The Wheeling AOH Irish Road Bowling 2026 McSweeney Cup\, the 
 largest Irish road bowling event in the world\, will take place Saturday\
 , September 26\, at Sonnborn Shelter in Wheeling Park. The event will fea
 ture Irish music from Bill Burns-Lynch\, The Jig-Offs and Brigid’s Cros
 s. Registration and check-in begin at 11 a.m.\, with road bowling startin
 g at noon\, followed by food\, drinks and more Irish music from 3–7 p.m
 . Teams may include up to five bowlers\, with registration costing $45 pe
 r person for bowling\, dinner\, drinks and music when registered before S
 eptember 21\, or $50 per person after September 21 or at the event. New t
 his year is a Friday night pre-party at Alpha Tavern. Team start times wi
 ll be assigned based on registration\, with teams beginning as early as n
 oon and as late as 4 p.m. Participants are encouraged to stay at the shel
 ter as long as possible before bowling to help avoid crowds at the starti
 ng line. The event is sponsored by Riverbridge Wealth Management/Raymond 
 James\, DUB V Flooring\, Panhandle Cleaning & Restoration\, Kalkreuth Res
 idential Roofing and Mansuetto Roofing & Sheet Metal.\nSchedule note: One
  Day Only\nCategories: Outdoors\, Sports\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com
 /events/wheeling-aoh-irish-road-bowling-2026-mcsweeney-cup/
LOCATION:Wheeling Park - Sonneborn Shelter\, 1801 National Road\, Wheelin
 g\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/wheeling-aoh-irish-road-bowling-2026-m
 csweeney-cup/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
