SUMMARY:Auggie's 5K Run & Walk
DTSTART:20261017T130000Z
DTEND:20261017T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:The 26th Annual Auggie's 5K Run & Walk\, which starts promptl
 y at 9:00 a.m.\, benefits the programming of the Ohio County Animal Shelt
 er. The flat and fast course\, which commences and ends at Warwood Middle
  School\, is on Wheeling's Heritage Trail along the Ohio River. Essential
 ly\, runners and walkers have separate\, out-and-back courses\, despite s
 tarting and finishing in the same area. Runners run north on the paved tr
 ail\, and walkers walk south. There will be post-race refreshments and do
 or prizes. Packet Pickup will start at 7:30 a.m. and end at 8:45 a.m.\, r
 ace day. Packets will not be available Friday evenint. Long-sleeve Tech S
 hirts with original artwork by WVU student Kendal Rownd are guaranteed to
  first 200 pre-registrants. Hoodies and Hats are available for purchase. 
 Gift Certificates & Custom Medallions to top 3 males & females of both th
 e run and the walk\, and custom medallions (artwork by Sherry Stauver) to
  top males & females in age divisions. Event details and schedule Packet 
 Pick-up: 7:30 to 8:45 a.m. Start Time: 9:00 a.m.\nSchedule note: One Day 
 Only\nCategories: Fundraiser\, Outdoors\, Sports\nSource: https://wheelin
 gcvb.com/events/auggies-5k-run-walk/
LOCATION:Warwood Middle School\, 150 Viking Drive\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/auggies-5k-run-walk/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
