UID:abc04b69ec130034d9773dba967767bd@wheelingfeeling.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260830T145313Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260830T145313Z
SUMMARY:Jazz at the Stifel: Rossano Sportiello's New York City All Stars
DTSTART:20261017T233000Z
DTEND:20261018T013000Z
DESCRIPTION:Rossano Sportiello’s New York City All Stars are: Harry All
 en – tenor sax Scott Robinson – clarinet and saxophone Danny Tobias 
 – trumpet Rossano Sportiello – piano Neal Miner – bass Kevin Dorn 
 – drums Internationally acclaimed jazz pianist Rossano Sportiello bring
 s his extraordinary touch\, effortless swing\, and unmistakable elegance 
 to Jazz at the Stifel this October. Born in Italy and now based in New Yo
 rk City\, Rossano is celebrated worldwide for his mastery of stride piano
 —a style he carries forward with dazzling technique\, warmth\, and deep
  respect for the greats who shaped it. A protégé of the legendary Barry
  Harris and praised by critics as one of today’s finest interpreters of
  classic jazz piano\, Rossano has performed at top venues and festivals a
 cross the U.S. and Europe\, from Lincoln Center and Carnegie Hall to the 
 Newport Jazz Festival. His playing blends the spirit of Fats Waller and T
 eddy Wilson with his own lyrical sensitivity\, creating performances that
  are both joyful and profoundly musical. Whether delivering a breathtakin
 g solo or swinging with a band\, Rossano’s artistry is defined by clari
 ty\, charm\, and an irresistible sense of rhythm. His appearance at the S
 tifel promises an evening of world‑class jazz that honors tradition whi
 le sparkling with fresh\, modern energy. For tickets call 304-242-7700 or
  CLICK HERE to purchase online.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategories:
  Music\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/jazz-at-the-stifel-rossano
 -sportiellos-new-york-city-all-stars/
LOCATION:Oglebay Institute's Stifel Fine Arts Center\, 1330 National Road
 \, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/jazz-at-the-stifel-rossano-sportiellos
 -new-york-city-all-stars/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
