DESCRIPTION:Junior Graphic Book Club - On the third Monday of each month\
 , this is an exciting book club for 3rd\, 4th and 5th grade students to e
 xplore and discuss fun\, age-appropriate graphic novels. Register by emai
 l: dianna.cornett@ohiocountylibrary.org\nSchedule note: Every Third Monda
 y\nCategories: Educational\, Family Fun\, Free Events\nSource: https://wh
