LAST-MODIFIED:20260830T145313Z
SUMMARY:Dinner & A Movie: "Nosferatu" w/ Live Score by Tom Roberts
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DESCRIPTION:Dinner & a Movie: Nosferatu with Live Score by Tom Roberts Og
 lebay Institute’s Towngate Theatre is proud to bring a cinematic legend
  to Wheeling in a one‑night‑only experience that has captivated—and
  sold out—audiences across Pittsburgh. Celebrate the haunting legacy of
  F.W. Murnau’s Nosferatu (1922)\, the iconic silent horror masterpiece 
 that continues to influence filmmakers more than a century later. This sp
 ecial Dinner & a Movie presentation features internationally acclaimed pi
 anist and composer Tom Roberts\, performing his original score live—a s
 core that premiered to two sold‑out crowds during the film’s 100th an
 niversary screenings with the Pittsburgh Silent Film Society . Roberts\, 
 known for arranging and performing music for Martin Scorsese’s The Avia
 tor and serving as musical director for Leon Redbone\, brings Nosferatu
 ’s eerie\, atmospheric world to life with a spellbinding performance th
 at transforms the film into an immersive\, unforgettable event. This is y
 our chance to experience the program that wowed Pittsburgh audiences—ri
 ght here at Towngate. Pair the film with a delicious dinner\, enjoy an ev
 ening steeped in artistry and history\, and witness one of cinema’s mos
 t unsettling and enduring vampire tales accompanied by a master musician.
  Don’t miss this rare opportunity. Seats will go fast. When: Friday\, O
 ctober 30 – Dinner 6:30pm – Movie 7:30pm Cost: for dinner is $40 and 
 includes movie ticket\, all food\, coffee\, tea\, water and a box of popc
 orn Tickets Click Here If you would like to attend the movie only\, you c
 an get your tickets at the box office for $20 each.\nSchedule note: One D
 ay Only\nCategories: Art\, Food And Wine\, Music\, Theater\nSource: https
 ://wheelingcvb.com/events/dinner-a-movie-nosferatu-w-live-score-by-tom-ro
 berts/
LOCATION:Oglebay Institute's Towngate Theatre & Cinema\, 2118 Market Stre
 et\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/dinner-a-movie-nosferatu-w-live-score-
 by-tom-roberts/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
