SUMMARY:Jam Night
DTSTART:20261106T000000Z
DTEND:20261106T030000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Ohio Valley Gigs every Thursday night for the premier mu
 sician’s jam session at the historic Waterfront Hall. Whether you are a
  seasoned pro looking to network or a rising talent ready to take the sta
 ge for the first time\, this is the place to connect with the local music
  community. The SetupLeave the heavy lifting to us! We provide a full pro
 fessional stage equipped with:Full drum kitGuitar and bass amplifiers pia
 no.Professional PA system and microphones How to PlayThe night is designe
 d for maximum flexibility. You can:Perform Solo: Show off your latest ori
 ginal or a favorite cover.Bring Your Band: Get some stage time with your 
 full group.Jam with the Pros: Don't have a band? Our talented House Band 
 is on standby to sit in and back you up on any style—from blues and roc
 k to jazz and country. Networking & CommunityThis isn't just a concert\; 
 it’s a hub for the Ohio Valley music scene. Use this night to meet pote
 ntial bandmates\, book future gigs\, and support your fellow local artist
 s in a collaborative\, high-energy environment. What to Bring: Just your 
 instrument (guitar\, bass\, horns\, etc.) and your talent! Admission is f
 ree for performers and spectators. Come for the music\, stay for the comm
 unity.\nSchedule note: Every Thursday\nCategories: Music\nSource: https:/
 /wheelingcvb.com/events/jam-night/
LOCATION:Waterfront Hall\, 1230 Water Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/jam-night/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:9682031813f07cf3af04c867ae0c8fd6@wheelingfeeling.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260830T145313Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260830T145313Z
SUMMARY:Justin Moore w/ Priscilla Block
DTSTART:20261106T000000Z
DTEND:20261106T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:Multi-PLATINUM hitmaker Justin Moore has built a loyal follow
 ing over the past decase with his traditional country sound and captivati
 ng live shows. His deeply personal latest single "This Is My Dirt" just e
 arned him his 13th No. 1\, and it follows the RIAA PLATINUM-certified "Yo
 u\, Me\, and Whiskey\," a smoldering duet with Priscilla Block. Over his 
 10+ year career\, Moore's No. 1 hits have included "Point at You\," "Lett
 in' The Night Roll" "If Heaven Wasn't So Far Away\," "Small Town USA" and
  "Till My Last Day\," as well as PLATINUM-certified albums and singles. T
 he Valory Music Co. recording artist has earned multiple ACM\, ACA\, CMT\
 , People's Choice\, and ACC Awards nominations\, as well as an ACM Award 
 win. In addition to multiple festivals\, headline shows and select direct
 -support dates\, Moore has also been busy hosting his Justin Moore Podcas
 t sponsored by Bobcat with tour manager JR\, interviewing guests such as 
 Oscar award-winning actor Matthew McConaughey\; Country stars Tracy Lawre
 nce\, Jon Pardi\, Brantley Gilbert\; wrestling champion Diamond Dallas Pa
 ge and ESPN's Marty Smith. He also recently took on a new role as co-host
  on 103.7 The Buzz's morning drive-time sports talk show\, "Morning Mayhe
 m\," where he spends his weekday mornings dishing out his never-ending sp
 orts knowledge on-air. WITH SPECIAL GUEST PRISCILLA BLOCK “This is me\,
 ” says Priscilla Block. “Love it or leave it.” With fearless honest
 y\, undeniable confidence\, and a whole lot of personality\, Priscilla ha
 s become one of country music’s most authentic and relatable voices. On
 e part endless party\, one part unfiltered truth\, and one part best frie
 nd who always tells it like it is\, she is redefining “three chords and
  the truth” for a new generation. Originally from Raleigh\, North Carol
 ina\, Priscilla moved to Nashville shortly after high school and spent ye
 ars writing songs\, playing wherever she could\, and working multiple job
 s to support her dream. When the COVID-19 pandemic brought live music to 
 a halt\, she turned to social media\, where honest and unapologetic songs
  like “Thick Thighs” and “PMS” quickly connected with fans and cl
 imbed to the top of the iTunes Country and All-Genre charts. Through hard
  work\, country grit\, and a fearless commitment to being herself\, Prisc
 illa has emerged as one of country music’s most exciting rising stars.\
 nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategories: Capitol Theatre\, Music\nSource
 : https://wheelingcvb.com/events/justin-moore-w-priscilla-block/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/justin-moore-w-priscilla-block/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
