SUMMARY:Broadway on Main Street: "Dolly Parton's Smoky Mountain Christmas
  Carol"
DTSTART:20261211T003000Z
DTEND:20261211T023000Z
DESCRIPTION:Right Angle Entertainment and Paul T. Couch are proud to pres
 ent the national tour of Dolly Parton's Smoky Mountain Christmas Carol\, 
 a heartwarming musical featuring music and lyrics by eleven-time GRAMMY w
 inner Dolly Parton and book by David H. Bell\, adapted by Bell\, Couch\, 
 and Curt Wollan. Set in the 1930s in the Smoky Mountains of East Tennesse
 e\, this unforgettable production and amazing cast imagines Ebenezer Scro
 oge as the owner of a mining company town\, where his callous greed blind
 s him to the joys and gifts of the season. As a Christmas Eve snowstorm a
 pproaches\, Scrooge is visited by his deceased business partner and three
  ghosts who compel him to see life anew and discover that love is the gre
 atets gift we have. The legendary holiday tale re-written as a new Americ
 an classic features Dickens' classic characters and Parton's one-of-a-kin
 d songwriting expertise\, making this a holiday event you'll want to shar
 e with those you love.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategories: Capitol 
 Theatre\, Theater\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/broadway-on-mai
 n-street-dolly-partons-smoky-mountain-christmas-carol/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/broadway-on-main-street-dolly-partons-
 smoky-mountain-christmas-carol/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
