LAST-MODIFIED:20260830T145313Z
SUMMARY:A Motown Christmas ft The Motortown All-Stars
DTSTART:20261214T000000Z
DTEND:20261214T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:A Motown Christmas is back bigger and better than ever in 202
 6\, this year with a live orchestra! The magic and music of Motown return
  to the Capitol Theatre just in time to get you into the holiday spirit! 
 The Motortown All-Stars are back by popular demand with an all-star line-
 up of vocalists and musicians assembled from the ranks of the Miracles\, 
 the Contours and other Motown legends. These vocalists have each performe
 d with Motown icons on stages around the world and now they've come toget
 her to deliver all the biggest Motown hits\, complete with impeccable har
 monies\, flashy outfits and that dazzling choreography. A live band of th
 e finest players out of Detroit (complete with live brass) adds yet anoth
 er level of excitement to those instantly-recognizable grooves. You’ll 
 hear all the Temptations\, Four Tops\, Jackson Five\, Stevie Wonder and S
 upremes’ hits you know and love like “My Girl”\, “Ain't Too Proud
  to Beg”\, “Ooh Baby\, Baby”\, “Signed\, Sealed\, Delivered” as
  well as holiday classics like "Santa Claus is Coming to Town" and "Silen
 t Night" performed in that inimitable Motown style. So\, “Get Ready”.
 .. It’s the most wonderful time of the year and this will be this show
 ’s only area appearance this holiday season.\nSchedule note: One Day On
 ly\nCategories: Capitol Theatre\, Holiday\, Music\nSource: https://wheeli
 ngcvb.com/events/a-motown-christmas-ft-the-motortown-all-stars/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/a-motown-christmas-ft-the-motortown-al
 l-stars/
