UID:2cee861f5099b559ea5ca9b81ea9783e@wheelingfeeling.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260830T145313Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260830T145313Z
SUMMARY:Cirque Dreams Holidaze
DTSTART:20261218T003000Z
DTEND:20261218T023000Z
DESCRIPTION:CIRQUE DREAMS HOLIDAZE dazzles with a brillantly breathtaking
  holiday spectacular for the entire family. As the orginal cirque holiday
  theatrical event\, this annual tradition wraps a Broadway-style producti
 on around awe-inspiring contemporary circus acts. Guests of all ages will
  be on the edge of their seats as a cast of holiday characters come to li
 fe\, captivating audiences while defying gravity. Broadway World exclaims
 \, "Lose yourself for 90 minutes and go back to those wonderful dreams yo
 u had as a kid." On Christmas Eve\, young Clara returns home only to lear
 n that a snowstorm may keep her family from joining her. As loneliness be
 gins to settle in\, two whimsical singers appear and whisk her away into 
 HOLIDAZE — a fantastical world full of color\, wonder\, and breathtakin
 g circus acts. As she journeys through this magical realm\, Clara becomes
  part of the adventure\, forming unexpected friendships and discovering h
 er own courage. In a joyful twist\, Clara is reunited with her loved ones
 \, takes flight in a soaring aerial peformance\, and joins the entire cas
 t in a heartwarming celebration of imagination\, connection\, and the tru
 e spirt of Christmas. Reimagined for 2026\, CIRQUE DREAMS HOLIDAZE featur
 es a world-renowned cast of performers including an ensemble of aerial ci
 rcus acts\, sleight-of-hand jugglers\, fun-loving skippers\, eye-popping 
 acrobatics\, and much more. Singers\, dancers\, toy soliders\, and reinde
 er invoke the dreams behind a child's eye on the most magical of nights. 
 Featuring new music including beloved holiday favorites sung live\, new s
 ets\, sparkling scenery and stunning costumes\, CIRQUE DREAMS HOLIDAZE th
 e ultimate holiday gift!\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nSource: https://wh
 eelingcvb.com/events/cirque-dreams-holidaze/
LOCATION:Capitol Theatre\, 1015 Main Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/cirque-dreams-holidaze/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
