 elebrating regional creativity. This vibrant market offers a welcoming sp
 ace to connect with makers and shop unique\, locally made products. Follo
 w us on Facebook or Instagram for updates.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\n
 Categories: Art\, Shopping\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/handma
