 in Street Bank\, The Stuckey Firm\, Edward Jones\, and the Wheeling-Ohio 
 County CVB. Thank you for helping to make these events possible at Centre
  Market! Schedule is as follows:May 23 - Robert "The Troubadour" GaudioMa
 y 30 - Ananga Martin June 6 - Talan ChambersJune 20 - Gregg MolnarJune 27
  - Donnie D. & Mike July 11 - Shawn VillamagnaJuly 18 - Sean DeckerJuly 2
 5 - New Age Adenas August 1 - Ashley BestAugust 8 - D David StilesAugust 
 15 - Dan EvickAugust 22 - Jason TreumanAugust 29 - Zoe Bucella September 
 5 - Chuck LucasSeptember 12 - James McLaughlinSeptember 26 - Matt & Fran 
 These events are sponsored by the City of Wheeling. No smoking is permitt
 ed by order of the Wheeling-Ohio County Health Board. Alcohol is permitte
 d in accordance with Public Outdoor Designated Area (PODA) rules and regu
 lations. All programs are subject to change without notice. In case of in
 clement weather\, events may be relocated\, rescheduled or cancelled. For
  a full list of City-sponsored events\, visit wheelingwv.gov/summerevents
 .\nSchedule note: Every Saturday\nCategories: Music\, Outdoors\nSource: h
 ttps://wheelingcvb.com/events/saturdays-at-the-market/
