DTSTAMP:20260822T104352Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260822T104352Z
SUMMARY:Moon River StarWatch
DTSTART:20260823T000000Z
DTEND:20260823T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:Moon River StarWatch! These family-friendly events will be he
 ld on the fourth Saturday of each month from 8-10pm when the Earth’s Mo
 on will be visible in Wheeling’s evening sky. Telescopes will be made a
 vailable for viewing Earth’s Moon\, the planets Mars and Jupiter\, and 
 brighter Deep Space Objects. If you have your own telescope bring it alon
 g – the more the merrier. Meet at the Wheeling Walking Trail at Wheelin
 g’s Waterfront just north of the Walter Reuther statue and just south o
 f the “Wooden Swing”. In case of clouds\, amateur astronomers will st
 ill be on hand to discuss and answer your astronomically related question
 s. Sponsored by SMART-Center\, SMART Centre Market\, Near Earth Object Fo
 undation\, Wheeling Parks and Recreation\, and a partnership grant with W
 heeling National Heritage Corporation.\nSchedule note: Every Fourth Satur
 day\nCategories: Educational\, Free Events\, Outdoors\nSource: https://wh
 eelingcvb.com/events/moon-river-starwatch/
LOCATION:Wheeling Heritage Port\, 1201 Water Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/moon-river-starwatch/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
