 ave a sound system and refreshments. This is our first event\, so come pr
 epared for anything! Non-musical acts\, such as storytelling or comedy sk
 etches that fit our general theme will also be considered. All acts must 
 be family friendly. Preference will be given to acts that have an old tim
 e country\, traditional\, Americana\, bluegrass\, blues\, or gospel flavo
 r. No karaoke or pre-recorded music. Acts that are accepted will be sched
 uled to perform live at the event. $5.00 donation admission. Free admissi
 on for children age 12 and under. Proceeds benefit Cornerstone Christian 
 Academy. Email beechbottomvarietyshow@gmail.com before August 15th if you
  would like to perform a song or two for the show.\nSchedule note: One Da
 y Only\nCategories: Art\, Comedy\, Dance\, Family Fun\, Music\, Theater\n
