SUMMARY:Mountaineer Brewfest
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260816
DESCRIPTION:🍻 West Virginia’s premier craft beer festival is back! T
 he Mountaineer Brewfest returns to Wheeling for a day of great West Virgi
 nia craft beer\, live music\, and unforgettable festival vibes. The date 
 for this year’s festival is Saturday\, August 15\, 2026 The festival ho
 urs are: VIP entry 3:00 pm\; General Admission entry at 4:00 pm\; and the
  festival ends at 10:00 pm. **TICKETS GO ON SALE JUNE 1ST** COST (until J
 uly 31): General Admission - $35 VIP Admission - $70 VIP Admission + Thur
 sday VIP Pairing ticket - $80 COST (after July 31): General Admission - $
 45 VIP Admission - $80 **Designated Driver tickets will also be available
 ** This is a rain or shine event. Please visit www.mountaineerbrewfest.co
 m to purchase tickets and for more information. Please Note: ➡️ You m
 ust be 21 years of Age to enter\, no exceptions. Valid photo ID required 
 for entry. ➡️ Wheeling Heritage Port is a smoke free venue. ➡️ No
  pets permitted except service animals. ➡️ No large bags or coolers a
 llowed\, all bags and backpacks are subject to search. ➡️ No outside 
 food or beverage permitted. ➡️ Tickets are not transferable. ➡️ T
 icket sales are non-refundable.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategories:
  Festivals\, Food And Wine\, Music\, Outdoors\nSource: https://wheelingcv
 b.com/events/mountaineer-brewfest/
LOCATION:Wheeling Heritage Port\, 1201 Water Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/mountaineer-brewfest/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
