DTSTART:20260814T220000Z
DTEND:20260815T023000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Pepsi Summer Concert Series is returning to the WesBanco 
 Arena Patio this summer — and this year it’s presented by Gumby’s! 
 Join us for four nights of live music\, cold drinks\, food favorites\, an
 d patio vibes in downtown Wheeling. WesBanco Arena Patio 6PM–10:30PM FR
 EE Admission August 14 — Carly Greer & The Hooch Carly Greer is quickly
  making a name for herself with powerhouse vocals and high-energy perform
 ances. A 2X Josie Music Award Winner — including Band of the Year with 
 her bluegrass group Crandall Creek — Carly has also earned 5 Josie Musi
 c Award nominations\, along with Vocalist of the Year nominations from bo
 th the Grand Ole Opry’s Josie Music Awards and the International Bluegr
 ass Music Awards (IBMA). Backed by her band\, The Hooch\, Carly delivers 
 a dynamic blend of country\, bluegrass\, and soulful live music you won
 ’t want to miss. Returning all season long: Big Timber Brewing Tap Take
 over Nail City Records Pop-Up Shop So Nuts 4 Donuts NEW THIS YEAR — VIN
 YL JAM Hosted by Nail City Records from 6PM–7:30PM before each band\, V
 inyl Jam will feature a hand-picked collection of records curated special
 ly for that evening’s lineup. Also new this summer: Kona Brewing BIG BI
 TES Food Tent Island-inspired flavors meet refreshing craft beer with a m
 enu featuring teriyaki lo mein\, crispy pot stickers\, BBQ pulled pork sa
 ndwiches\, and more bold Pacific-style bites. Whether you’re coming for
  the music\, the food\, the beer\, or the atmosphere — the patio is the
  place to be this summer.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCategories: Free 
 Events\, Music\, Outdoors\nSource: https://wheelingcvb.com/events/pepsi-s
 ummer-concert-series-carly-greer-the-hooch/
LOCATION:WesBanco Arena Patio\, 2 14th Street\, Wheeling\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/pepsi-summer-concert-series-carly-gree
 r-the-hooch/
