DTSTAMP:20260811T110746Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T110746Z
SUMMARY:Ohio County Master Gardeners Monthly Meeting: Guest Speaker - Tak
 ako Sachse
DTSTART:20260811T223000Z
DTEND:20260812T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:The speaker at the August 11 meeting of the Ohio County Maste
 r Gardeners will be Takako Sachse. She will be demonstrating Ikebana\, th
 e classic Japanese art of flower arranging. The meeting will be held 6:30
 \, at Vance Memorial Church\, 905 National Road. Takako Sachse is a certi
 fied instructor of Sogetsu Ikebana School\, and has been a long-time memb
 er of Sogetsu Pittsburgh where Reiko Nakajima and Atsumi Sewell are princ
 ipal instructors who conduct the study group. Currently a major project i
 s exhibited at Carnegie Museum of Art where you are greeted by magnificen
 t bamboo installations that were designed and directed by Ken Katayama\, 
 a master instructor of Sogetsu Headquarter\, Tokyo\, Japan. Sogetsu Pitts
 burgh offers a monthly study class in Pittsburgh and shares its activitie
 s on Instagram. https://www.instagram.com/sogetsu.ikebana.pittsburgh If y
 ou are interested in the Sogetsu study class\, please contact Brittany Re
 illy. mailto: reilly.k.britt@gmail.com For more information regarding the
  Master Gardener Program\, contact the Ohio County Extension Office by em
 ailing OhioCountyExtension@mail.wvu.edu or calling 304-234-3673. https://
 extension.wvu.edu/lawn-gardening-pests/master-gardener-program\nSchedule 
 note: One Day Only\nCategories: Agricultural\, Educational\nSource: https
 ://wheelingcvb.com/events/ohio-county-master-gardeners-monthly-meeting/
LOCATION:Vance Memorial Presbyterian Church\, 905 National Road\, Wheelin
 g\, WV 26003
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/ohio-county-master-gardeners-monthly-m
 eeting/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
