DTSTAMP:20260804T122110Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804T122110Z
SUMMARY:National Night Out
DTSTART:20260804T220000Z
DTEND:20260805T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Wheeling Police Department and several community partners
  invite the public to participate in National Night Out on Tuesday\, Aug.
  4\, 2026\, from 6-8 p.m. at Wheeling Park’s Ice Rink. Now in its 43rd 
 year\, National Night Out is an annual community-building campaign that p
 romotes police-community partnerships and neighborhood camaraderie. The n
 ationwide event\, held each year on the first Tuesday of August\, provide
 s an opportunity to bring police and the community together under positiv
 e circumstances. The relaxed\, fun-filled ‘night out’ is geared towar
 d enhancing relationships between residents and law enforcement to make n
 eighborhoods safe. The evening also allows people to learn about anti-cri
 me awareness programs in the city\, such as neighborhood watch meetings a
 nd the citizens' police academy. During the free two-hour event\, Wheelin
 g Police will showcase its many units and divisions\, including a demonst
 ration from its K9 Unit around 7 p.m. Pizza\, popsicles\, snacks\, and dr
 inks will be provided\, and several displays from various local support a
 gencies will also be part of the event.\nSchedule note: One Day Only\nCat
 egories: Educational\, Family Fun\, Free Events\nSource: https://wheeling
 cvb.com/events/national-night-out/
LOCATION:Wheeling Park Ice Rink\, 1801 National Road\, Wheeling\, WV 2600
 3
URL:https://wheelingcvb.com/events/national-night-out/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
